  "content": "\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;<em>Identity</em>&nbsp;是一款受&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/morph\" rel=\"nofollow\">Morph</a>&nbsp;啟發的模組，最初為 Fabric 模組載入器開發，現在可透過 Architectury 在 Forge 上使用。若要查看關於設定 Identity &amp; 與其 API 互動的資訊，<a href=\"https://github.com/Draylar/identity/wiki\" rel=\"nofollow\">請前往維基頁面</a>！</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">此專案需要於 Fabric &amp; Forge 上安裝 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/architectury-api\" rel=\"nofollow\">Architectury API </a>。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">透過&nbsp;<em>Identity</em>，你可以變成任何你想要的樣子：敵人或朋友、寒冷或炎熱、柔軟或粗糙。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/ypdqdDU.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1125\" height=\"596\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/B1iV81n.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1125\" height=\"596\"></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fcamo.githubusercontent.com%252f9eab3752713ce2496761d2ae215783aa19fe056d%252f68747470733a2f2f692e696d6775722e636f6d2f7a4d68504666482e706e67\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://camo.githubusercontent.com/9eab3752713ce2496761d2ae215783aa19fe056d/68747470733a2f2f692e696d6775722e636f6d2f7a4d68504666482e706e67\" alt=\"\"></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fcamo.githubusercontent.com%252f5875dabf34c3506e13530cd73dfb67c6b85b0a67%252f68747470733a2f2f692e696d6775722e636f6d2f30376b487646742e706e67\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://camo.githubusercontent.com/5875dabf34c3506e13530cd73dfb67c6b85b0a67/68747470733a2f2f692e696d6775722e636f6d2f30376b487646742e706e67\" alt=\"\"></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fcamo.githubusercontent.com%252fabe860344f843b7303e03eec09086eef2c474345%252f68747470733a2f2f692e696d6775722e636f6d2f4837696239374e2e706e67\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://camo.githubusercontent.com/abe860344f843b7303e03eec09086eef2c474345/68747470733a2f2f692e696d6775722e636f6d2f4837696239374e2e706e67\" alt=\"\"></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fcamo.githubusercontent.com%252f04ad10a80b914173ceca4aecd5ca0e1aa10891ae%252f68747470733a2f2f692e696d6775722e636f6d2f544d41305051572e706e67\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://camo.githubusercontent.com/04ad10a80b914173ceca4aecd5ca0e1aa10891ae/68747470733a2f2f692e696d6775722e636f6d2f544d41305051572e706e67\" alt=\"\"></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fcamo.githubusercontent.com%252fe969e8fa7f814624b80e88041756518882164fb2%252f68747470733a2f2f692e696d6775722e636f6d2f56797a614359332e706e67\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://camo.githubusercontent.com/e969e8fa7f814624b80e88041756518882164fb2/68747470733a2f2f692e696d6775722e636f6d2f56797a614359332e706e67\" alt=\"\"></a></p>\n<h4><a href=\"https://github.com/Draylar/identity#getting-started\" rel=\"nofollow\"></a>快速開始</h4>\n<p>要解鎖 <em>Identity</em>，請擊殺附近的生物。你會在快捷欄上方看到通知，告知你已解鎖該身份。接著按下 ` 鍵即可在不同身份之間切換。裝備好 Identity 後，按下「R」鍵即可使用其能力。若要查看所有可用能力，請參閱此維基頁面 <a href=\"https://github.com/Draylar/identity/wiki/Abilities\" rel=\"nofollow\">這裡</a>。</p>\n<h4><a href=\"https://github.com/Draylar/identity#license\" rel=\"nofollow\"></a>授權條款</h4>\n<p>Identity 採用 MIT 授權條款。</p>",
